    <bpmn:process id="W_W1913" name="W1913. Digital Commerce Competitive Benchmarking &amp; Online Price Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly competitive e-commerce review
Frequency: Monthly review
Volume: 3–5 competitor websites + major marketplaces (Shopee, Lazada)
Owner: Market Research Analyst
Participants: Market Research Analyst, Ecommerce Team, Category Manager
Source: workflow W1913 — Digital Commerce Competitive Benchmarking &amp; Online Price Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1913_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1913_Lane1" name="Market Research Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1913_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1913_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1913_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1913_Lane2" name="Ecommerce Team">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1913_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1913_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1913_Start4" name="Monthly competitive e-commerce review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1913_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1913_Task5" name="Monthly: Market Research Analyst benchmarks competitor digital presence: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly: Market Research Analyst benchmarks competitor digital presence: (a) website/app experience: navigation, search functionality, product content quality, mobile experience, (b) pricing: compare online prices for 50–100 benchmark SKUs across BuildRight, Wilcon, CitiHardware, ACE, Shopee, Lazada, (c) fulfillment options: delivery speed, BOPIS availability, delivery fees, (d) promotional activity: online-only deals, flash sales, bundle offers, (e) customer reviews: ratings and review counts for comparable products, (f) social media: follower counts, engagement rates, content quality
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 2–3 days/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1913_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1913_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1913_Task6" name="Analysis: (a) online price competitiveness: is BuildRight&#x27;s ecommerce pricing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Analysis: (a) online price competitiveness: is BuildRight&#x27;s ecommerce pricing aligned with or better than competitors?, (b) content quality gap: do competitor product pages have better photos, videos, or descriptions?, (c) fulfillment competitiveness: delivery speed and cost comparison, (d) digital marketing effectiveness: competitor social media engagement vs. BuildRight, (e) marketplace presence: are competitors selling on Shopee/Lazada? Should BuildRight?
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1913_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1913_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1913_Task7" name="Ecommerce Team and Category Manager action findings: (a) adjust online pricing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ecommerce Team and Category Manager action findings: (a) adjust online pricing if significantly uncompetitive, (b) improve product content for SKUs where competitors have superior listings, (c) evaluate marketplace listing strategy per W10.3, (d) adjust digital marketing strategy per W14.2
Responsible (R): Ecommerce Team / Category Manager
Accountable (A): CMO / VP Merchandising
Duration: Per findings</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1913_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1913_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1913_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1913_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-374 (ensure controlled execution — Market &amp; Competitive Intelligence (PA-44.2).) | - operational: Market Research Analyst review and approval gate
Owner: Market Research Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
