    <bpmn:process id="W_W1917" name="W1917. Competitive Intelligence Report &amp; Strategic Decision Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly reporting cycle; strategic decision support request
Frequency: Monthly competitive intelligence report; ad-hoc for strategic decisions
Volume: Comprehensive monthly report covering all competitive intelligence
Owner: Market Research Analyst
Participants: Market Research Analyst, CMO, VP Merchandising, VP Store Operations, FP&amp;A
Source: workflow W1917 — Competitive Intelligence Report &amp; Strategic Decision Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1917_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1917_Lane1" name="Market Research Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1917_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1917_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1917_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1917_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1917_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1917_Start3" name="Monthly reporting cycle; strategic decision support request">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1917_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1917_Task4" name="Monthly: Market Research Analyst compiles competitive intelligence report: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Monthly: Market Research Analyst compiles competitive intelligence report: (a) competitor store openings and closings, (b) competitor promotional activity summary, (c) price benchmarking summary (key SKUs vs. competitors), (d) digital commerce competitive summary, (e) product assortment news (new products, discontinued products), (f) competitor financial performance (Wilcon Depot quarterly results — publicly listed), (g) industry news: trade association updates, regulatory changes, construction industry trends, (h) social media sentiment: BuildRight vs. competitors
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 2 days/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1917_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1917_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1917_Task5" name="Distribute to leadership: (a) VP Merchandising: pricing and assortment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Distribute to leadership: (a) VP Merchandising: pricing and assortment implications, (b) VP Store Operations: store experience and competitive positioning, (c) CMO: marketing and digital implications, (d) CFO/FP&amp;A: financial impact assessment, (e) COO: expansion/contraction implications
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 1 day/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1917_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1917_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1917_Task6" name="Ad-hoc: Market Research Analyst supports strategic decisions with competitive…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Ad-hoc: Market Research Analyst supports strategic decisions with competitive intelligence: (a) new market entry: competitive landscape assessment for BuildRight expansion cities, (b) category entry: competitive analysis for new product categories BuildRight is considering, (c) pricing strategy: competitive price positioning for specific categories, (d) acquisition evaluation: if BuildRight considers acquiring smaller competitor
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Per request</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1917_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1917_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1917_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1917_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-190 (protect research-participant data &amp; insight validity.) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Market Research Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
